<title>JAPAN: Sakura extends subordinated loans to Yamatane Sec.</title>
<headline>Sakura extends subordinated loans to Yamatane Sec.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Sakura Bank Ltd on Monday extended subordinated loans worth six billion yen to Yamatane Securities Co Ltd, Yamatane said in a satement.</p>
<p>Yamatane said Sakura's five-year loans would help improve its financial situation.</p>
</text>
